          "min_libbridgething_version": "0.12.1",
          "changelog": "- Portrait layout: the two landscape panels stack top/bottom, sized\n  proportionally to their landscape widths (station list 68% on top,\n  Now Playing 32% below). Header stacks the search under the brand row,\n  tabs scroll horizontally, country tiles use two columns.\n- Landscape (800x480) is unchanged."
        },
        {
          "version": "0.6.5",
          "released_at": "2026-09-21T01:50:08.275Z",
          "download": {
            "url": "https://dharmapoudel.github.io/atlas-radio-source/r/01a08604-de6f-7a9f-a11e-1b4233458b2a/0.6.5.zip",
